{"id":353,"name":"Mason's Troll Moors ND","bottom":37101,"top":37300,"lifespan":30,"resetMode":2,"rooms":[{"vnum":37101,"name":"Entrance to the Troll Camp","desc":"As you approach an opening in the trees, you faintly hear gutteral\nvoices nearby.  The ground here begins to soften and the trees all\nseem to be mishapen and twisted.  The smell of decay hangs thick\nin the air.  There is a battered sign here.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37102,"flags":["door"]}],"extras":[{"keywords":"sign","desc":"               Beware those that enter the Troll Moors.\n                 One wrong step could spell your doom."}],"pos":[-258,0,2]},{"vnum":37102,"name":"Passage in the Moors","desc":"After moving through the entrance, you notice that the voices are\nlouder and seem to be coming from all sides.  A mist hangs in the\nair here.  It is very humid and breathing is difficult.  The trail\ngoes east and west here.  The exit to the swamp lies south.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37103,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":2,"to":37101,"keywords":"south","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37122,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-258,0,1]},{"vnum":37103,"name":"East-West passage through the swamp","desc":"Flies buzz around your head as you start moving into the swamp. \nYou catch glimpses of things moving in the fetid waters, things\nthat you probably don't want to meet.  The passage heads east and west.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37104,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37102,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-257,0,1]},{"vnum":37104,"name":"In the swamp","desc":"As you continue to move deeper into the swamp, you get an eerie\nfeeling that you are being watched.  You hear voices and see a\nlight shining through the trees to the north.  The trail leads\neast and west.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37119,"keywords":"north","flags":["door"]},{"dir":1,"to":37105,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37103,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-256,0,1]},{"vnum":37105,"name":"In the swamp","desc":"The ground continues to get softer and spongier, making it\ndifficult to walk.  You see many dark shapes gliding through\nthe waters around you.  The trail continues east and west.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37106,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37104,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-255,0,1]},{"vnum":37106,"name":"In the swamp","desc":"The swamp seems to come alive for a second as you trip and \nfall into the dark waters.  As you pull yourself out, you feel\nmany burning sensations on your body...Ack..leeches!  You quickly\npull them off before they can cause any harm.  The trail continues\neast and west.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37107,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37105,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-254,0,1]},{"vnum":37107,"name":"Bend in the path","desc":"The trail turns north here, leading even deeper into the gloom.\nYou are startled by a loud splash!  Looking around, you feel\nrelieved to see that it was just a dead branch that fell into the\nwater...but why did it fall?\nThe path goes west and north.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37108,"keywords":"north","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37106,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-253,0,1]},{"vnum":37108,"name":"Dead trees","desc":"A large pile of dead trees lies here, blocking the trail to\nthe north.  You see many small, glowing eyes watching you\nfrom inside the pile.  The path heads east and south here.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37109,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":2,"to":37107,"keywords":"south","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-253,0,0]},{"vnum":37109,"name":"Intersection in the swamp","desc":"The ground here is much more solid now.  The trees still grow\ntwisted and deformed.  To the north you see a pool of water.\nThe path continues east and west.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37110,"keywords":"north","flags":["door"]},{"dir":1,"to":37112,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37108,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-252,0,0]},{"vnum":37110,"name":"Dark pool","desc":"The water is covered with a layer of film, it is quite stagnant.\nThe stench is almost overpowering, causing you to gag.  There is\na large mound to the north and you see a dark path to the south.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"water_swim","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37111,"keywords":"north","flags":["door"]},{"dir":2,"to":37109,"keywords":"south","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-252,0,-1]},{"vnum":37111,"name":"Large mound","desc":"This appears to be a nest of some sort.  You hear a croaking \nnoise that sounds too deep to be from a frog.  You hear a\nsound at the water's edge and turn to see a large alligator\ncoming out of the water.  It might not be a bad idea to move.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":2,"to":37110,"keywords":"south","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-252,0,-2]},{"vnum":37112,"name":"On the swamp path","desc":"This place is really starting to get to you.  Everywhere you\nlook you see decay.  The constant droaning of the flies is\ngiving you a splitting headache.  You see the path branches\nsouth here and also goes east and west.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37114,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":2,"to":37113,"keywords":"south","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37109,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-251,0,0]},{"vnum":37113,"name":"Small clearing","desc":"Through the trees, you can actually see the sky!  This is the\nfirst time since you entered the swamp you have seen through\nthe thick canopy of twisted tree branches.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37112,"keywords":"north","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-251,0,1]},{"vnum":37114,"name":"Dead end","desc":"You have reached a dead end in the path.  The path heads back\nto the west from here.","teleport":{"time":20,"target":37115,"flags":["look"]},"flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":3,"to":37112,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-250,0,0]},{"vnum":37115,"name":"Troll Hole- Ambushed!","desc":"Through your own carelessness you have fallen into a troll\nhole.  The trolls here look mean and hungry.  The passage\ngoes east.","teleport":{"time":10,"target":37115,"flags":["look"]},"flags":["dark"],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37116,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-251,-1,1]},{"vnum":37116,"name":"Inside troll hole","desc":"Bones litter the floor here.  From the looks of it, the \ntrolls eat quite well.  You can either go west or north\nhere.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37117,"keywords":"north","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37115,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-250,-1,1]},{"vnum":37117,"name":"Inside troll hole","desc":"This part of the hole must be the communal waste chamber.\nThe smell in here is so bad it makes your eyes water.\nThe passage leads south and west.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":2,"to":37116,"keywords":"south","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37118,"keywords":"edit west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-250,-1,0]},{"vnum":37118,"name":"Inside troll hole","desc":"This room contains absolutely nothing.  The exit lies to the\neast and on closer inspection of the room, you notice some\nvines hanging down from above.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37117,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":4,"to":37112,"keywords":"up","flags":["door","secret"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-251,-1,0]},{"vnum":37119,"name":"Near the fire","desc":"This area has been cleared of debris.  The ground is quite\nsolid and the trees appear to be alive.  You hear voices\nfrom the north.  The path goes south here.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37120,"keywords":"north","flags":["door"]},{"dir":2,"to":37104,"keywords":"south","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-256,0,0]},{"vnum":37120,"name":"Entrance to the campfire","desc":"You see trolls all around here.  To the west you can see many\ntrolls sleeping.  There is a trail heading south.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":2,"to":37119,"keywords":"south","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37121,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-256,0,-1]},{"vnum":37121,"name":"Troll Reception","desc":"This is the troll sleeping area.  The exit lies to the east.","flags":["indoors","peaceful","no_summon"],"sector":"inside","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37120,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-257,0,-1]},{"vnum":37122,"name":"Path in the swamp","desc":"This path appears to lead deeper into the swamp.  The ground\nis soft and spongy and the trees are covered with a layer of \nslime.  There is a trail that branches off to the north and\nthe path you're on goes east and west.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37123,"keywords":"north","flags":["door"]},{"dir":1,"to":37102,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37125,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-259,0,1]},{"vnum":37123,"name":"Dark trail","desc":"This trail is extremely dark.  Small, glowing eyes peer at\nyou from the gloom.  The sound of frogs is heavy in the air.\nThe trail travels north and south.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37124,"keywords":"north","flags":["door"]},{"dir":2,"to":37122,"keywords":"south","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-259,0,0]},{"vnum":37124,"name":"End of the dark trail","desc":"After travelling a short distance, the trail abruptly ends.  All\nof the normal sounds of the swamp have stopped.  An eerie feeling\ncreeps into your body.  The path heads back south.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":2,"to":37123,"keywords":"south","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-259,0,-1]},{"vnum":37125,"name":"In the swamp","desc":"Flies buzz, and frogs croak as you continue moving into\nthe swamp.  You hear splashing sounds in the waters around\nyou, making you a little more cautious.  The path goes\neast and west.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37122,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37126,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-260,0,1]},{"vnum":37126,"name":"Fork in the path","desc":"The path forks here heading north and continuing to go\neast and west.  The ground is noticably drier here and\nthe trees aren't as mishapen.","flags":[],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":0,"to":37141,"keywords":"north","flags":["door"]},{"dir":1,"to":37125,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37127,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-261,0,1]},{"vnum":37127,"name":"Path in the swamp","desc":"The path here is quite overgrown, making it dark and difficult\nto travel through.  You have to hack away many vines and bushes\nto pass by.  The path continues east and west.","flags":["dark"],"sector":"forest","exits":[{"dir":1,"to":37126,"keywords":"east","flags":["door"]},{"dir":3,"to":37128,"keywords":"west","flags":["door"]}],"extras":[],"pos":[-262,0,1]},{"vnum":37128,"name":"37128","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-263,0,1]},{"vnum":37129,"name":"37129","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-247,0,-2]},{"vnum":37130,"name":"37130","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-244,0,-2]},{"vnum":37131,"name":"37131","desc":"Empty","flags":[],"sector":"inside","exits":[],"extras":[],"pos":[-241,0,-2]},{"vnum":37132,"name":"37132","d